  "notes": "Desktop is the standard layout. appearance=soft insets the companion as a borderless rounded card with the theme-aware color.selected fill; the open surface remains the default. Without good-assistant-mobile, a mobile button opens the full companion from the right. With it, the caller-supplied preview docks at the bottom and opens a bottom sheet. hideOnMobile removes the companion. The main section owns responsive padding; no fixed pixel height is required. Colors bind to shared layout tokens."
